  "prefLabel": "He-P 827.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 827.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the special health care service licensing requirements for freestanding megavoltage radiation therapy facility (FMRTF) services pursuant to RSA 151:2-e, II(c).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-P 827) #12751, eff 3-26-19",
